      (font
        (size 2 2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid fa37e94d-56b4-4000-a4b0-c9b51f036352))
  (text "Inter-sheet connections use global labels. Power nets: GND (signal), PGND (power return), +12V, +5V, +3V3 (Blue Pill), VIN (30 V), +12V_SW (after safety switch K4)."
